  "abstract": "This paper surveys observational indicators that entropy gradients play a central role in cosmic evolution. It synthesizes evidence from the CMB, galaxy clusters, the cosmic web, and black hole environments, and argues that entropy gradients modulate structure formation and local space-time expansion/compression.",
